ng interesting decisions on your journey.", "summary": "Alkahest is an Action-Adventure RPG set in a murky medieval world. Where satisfying melee combat with highly interactive environments takes center stage. Explore realistic locations, learn alchemy and make a name for your family.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/alkahest", "videos": [{"id": 117401, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "DhhTBPFz_GY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DhhTBPFz_GY", "title": "Alkahest - Official Announce Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/DhhTBPFz_GY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 150681, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "KjuI_FgJ3NM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KjuI_FgJ3NM", "title": "Alkahest \u2013 Official Teaser Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KjuI_FgJ3NM/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 180747, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "SMzgPFs9eVM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SMzgPFs9eVM", "title": "Alkahest - Gameplay Reveal Trailer | The Triple-i Initiative", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SMzgPFs9eVM/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 186830, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "rZa84qit0BI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rZa84qit0BI", "title": "Alkahest - Gameplay Trailer - FGS Live From LA 2026", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rZa84qit0BI/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}